     "clues": [0, 2],
     "clueWhy": {"zh": "前面是开会，后面说的是“谁做什么、什么时候交”：这里没有书，说的是大家想法一致。", "en": "Before: a meeting. After: who does what and when. There is no book here; it means everyone has the same understanding."},
